  <h1>What people have <em>read in the stars.</em></h1>
  <p class="lede">For about four thousand years people have looked at the sky for news about themselves. This section describes how that began, how it differs from one part of the world to another, how it changed, and how the horoscope in a newspaper or an app is produced today.</p>
